 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "GIRO makes software for the organizations that run public transport and postal delivery services, covering the work from planning through daily operations. Its two product families, HASTUS and GeoRoute, are in use in more than 30 countries.",
   "The company grounds the work in knowledge of the problems those operators face day to day. GIRO states that more than 30% of its resources go to research and development. New ideas and solutions are developed with clients and validated by groups of users around the world.",
   "GIRO was founded in the 1970s through the work of a Universit\u00e9 de Montr\u00e9al student and his professor. That early work paved the way for the creation of both products. The company counts over 40 years of experience in the field. It also notes a ranking among the 300 largest companies in Quebec."
  ],
  "quote": {
   "text": "GIRO helps plan, schedule and operate high-quality public transport and postal delivery services, with software solutions adapted to your specific reality.",
   "url": "https://www.giro.ca"
